UID:10007565-1796828400-1796839200@stmikes.utoronto.ca
SUMMARY:SMC Christmas Market
DESCRIPTION:Save the date for our annual SMC Christmas Market! This year we will be hosting our first ever “indoor-outdoor” market\, with booths along Elmsley Lane as well as throughout Brennan Hall. All additional proceeds from the Market will go to St. Basil’s Out of the Cold Program. We hope to see you there!
URL:https://stmikes.utoronto.ca/event/smc-christmas-market
LOCATION:Elmsely Place\, Canada
END:VEVENT
